  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Ge tribe higher-ups seize on Fang Yuan’s idea to dig a canal and draw the river for defense against turtleback wolves, Ge tribe leader commands Ge Cui, Ge Xiang, and Ge Mi to lead the first, seventh, and eighteenth troops. They must stop current tasks at once and dig at the riverside, while the third, fifth, and sixteenth troops take over their unfinished work. An investigative Gu Master outside the tent receives the order, and letter Gu fly out moments later.",
